  "description": "<p>Prepare for cold weather with Rothco&rsquo;s Cold Weather All-Purpose Duty Gloves. These gloves are crafted with a moisture wicking polyester spandex fabric, combined with 5mm thick open-cell foam to draw moisture away from the body. Lined with Thermoblock insulation, the tactical gloves keep hands warm even in chilly conditions. The gloves are reinforced with a breathable waterproof bladder, ensuring hands stay dry. Featuring an elastic cuff with hook and loop closure, the cold weather gloves provide a secure fit. Finger and knuckle patches offer added protection, while the synthetic leather palm and fingers enhance grip and durability.</p>",
